        "content": "## CORE · Dispatcher\n**Purpose**: claim ready jobs (leases, per-type and global concurrency, recovery of expired leases) and start one Job runner per job.\n**Trigger**: every 10 s + direct call (fast path from Job runner, webhooks, cron).\n**Output**: none; runners run detached.\n**Side effects**: jobs -> running (claim_jobs).\n**TZ**: section 8 (resume after failure), architecture 4.2.",
        "height": 192,
        "width": 380,
        "color": 7
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "52aea1c4-3ae9-5547-a21a-33184a2147df",
